  <description>Test bolt: ISO 4762 M6x40 socket head cap screw uniformly scaled by 1.5 (M9x60 equivalent, non-standard size), zinc finish. Mesh: FreeCAD-library (ISO4762_Hex_Socket_Head_Cap_Screw_M6x40.stl), CC-BY 3.0, author obijuan, https://github.com/FreeCAD/FreeCAD-library commit f5ca01cdcaa2f69b9295a6382719c2d90628780c. M6x40 메시를 1.5배 확대해 사용(mm 단위 메시, scale 0.0015).</description>
